 Fantasy Football Scout! -  https://bit.ly/FFScoutHarry\n\n🏆 Top 5 FPL Ranks: 510th, 1,345th, 3,814th, 5,401st \u0026 6,470th! \n_____________\nLEAGUE CODES\n🏆 League Code: a6fgym - https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n🃏 Fantasy Challenge League: TBC\n___________\nUSEFUL FPL TOOLS\n📊 Win at FPL with Fantasy Football Scout! -  https://bit.ly/FFScoutHarry\n📅 Free Fixture Ticker, Projected Goals \u0026 Clean Sheet Odds! https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.u...\n📝 Future Plan your team with Plan FPL! - https://www.planfpl.com\n___________\nSOCIAL LINKS\n🌳 Link to all my socials! https://linktr.ee/FPL_Harry\n💻 Sign Up to Channel Membership for Extra Benefits!  -    / @fplharry  \n___________\nCONTACT ME\n📧  For inquiries of partnerships or sponsorships - please email Harry.Daniels@EngagePartnerships.uk\n🙋🏻‍♂️ Personal Emails - fpl.harry@gmail.com\n___________\n⏱️ Timestamps\n0:00 Intro\n0:30 Community Shield Discussion\n7:21 Tzolis\n9:01 Haaland\n11:09 No Haaland Draft\n12:20 Bruno Fernandes\n13:50 No Bruno Draft\n14:38 Bench Boost or Not?\n16:35 Spurs Defence\n17:42 Liverpool\n20:12 Joao Pedro\n21:25 Cheap Forwards\n22:30 Cheap Midfielders\n18:00 Outro\n___________\n\n#fpl  #fantasypremierleague  #premierleague #gw1","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":46,"length":27,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBcQ040EGAciEwi2sK-F8quWAxV6tGUDHem1FnBImqqenIDGtNMGygEEM9gjbA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVHY4YThNVEpmYWdkLVVEVW5KODRqNXxBR3JiS2FsdTFvTDR5SEtGaHdjMTM3Ti1ObXNFQTZtRnBDR3MxVTZYVUhXeEJpc21ieVUteHNWMHpuaTR3b2t6QmVjZjZXbkk0U2FWTnJQdXpqa3hkUmtPSk5uZWtwaTlzSXdX\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutHarry\u0026v=BqbSMAOHlRo","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVHY4YThNVEpmYWdkLVVEVW5KODRqNXxBR3JiS2FsdTFvTDR5SEtGaHdjMTM3Ti1ObXNFQTZtRnBDR3MxVTZ